        "description": "PT4115 buck converter LED driver. VIN_12V_24V input converted to constant current output for a 1W LED at 350mA. SW pin drives inductor-switch path to LED+. CSN senses current via external shunt resistor. DIM pin is PWM dimming input. EP thermal pad is grounded.",
